                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kedaunos ŋun kere, koloto luka Isirael kere luajaas nen oreria luka Yuda, kobilibilata ipirin, kojepejepata Aserim, kobilibilata aiboisio nuiceleleete ka itemwan ko Yuda kere ka Benyamin, koEpuraim da ka Manase, aitodol neamudiariata kes kere. Kosodete idwe kere luka Isirael aboŋun, ŋinituŋanan airumeteke oreriakec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
