        },
        {
          "text": " Kitetemik Kesekia abeanakin naka isasedotin ka Ilebin kwape ajaatar abeanakinetakec, ŋolituŋanan kwape ejaar aijaanakinike, isasedotin ka Ilebin kere, luka ainakineta nuicweio ka ainakineta nuka ainapakin, aijaanakin, ka aimal, ka aiturit korutei luka eidukuru loka EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
