              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kaijul luemaritai kaurikee naka isasedotin kwape ajaatar ikekia luka lukapapaakec, ka Ilebin ageun ka luka ikar akaisaarei ka adepar, kaswamukec kwape ajaatar abeanakinetakec; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
