          "text": " Ido lukodwe luka Aaron isasedotin, luajaas omanikoria luka ironyia luka ireriakec, kaŋolire kere, ajaas ituŋa luabilitai ikiroriakee, ainakin akorakineta mama ejaas lukiliok kere kosasedotin, ka ŋul kere luemaritai kaurikec koLebin.",
